  "notes": [
    "Setup: Player A has GD02-057 in slot1 (paired with any pilot). Player A also has another Unit in slot2 to pay the destroyFriendlyUnit cost. Player B has 2 Units with level <= 4 so the follow-up damage requires a target choice.",
    "Action (manual): Player A initiates attackUnit with attackerCarduid=GD02-057_unit_0001 targeting Player B slot1 unit.",
    "Expect: AttackPhaseEffectManager triggers GD02-057 (paired). Because destroyFriendlyUnit cost exists, a TARGET_CHOICE is enqueued for Player A to choose a friendly Unit (excluding the attacker) to destroy; notificationQueue receives TARGET_CHOICE.",
    "Action (manual): Player A resolves the cost TARGET_CHOICE selecting Player A slot2 unit.",
    "Expect: Selected friendly unit is destroyed (UNIT_DESTROYED_BY_EFFECT) and then a follow-up TARGET_CHOICE is enqueued to choose an enemy Unit with level <= 4 for 2 damage (notificationQueue receives TARGET_CHOICE).",
    "Action (manual): Player A resolves the follow-up TARGET_CHOICE selecting Player B slot2 unit.",
    "Expect: Selected enemy unit receives 2 damage (CARD_DAMAGED) and the original attack resumes with skipAttackPhaseEffects=true."
  ],
